                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset of the DARE-TU PhD project comprises two Annexes: A and B, respectively.\r\nAnnex A, in turn, has two parts: Part 1, the bibliographic information of all the references that were employed in the corresponding literature review process. Part 2, the worldwide application cases of hydro-powered pumping technologies in space and time, according the references of the first part.\r\nAnnex B is the narrative of the evolution of hydro-powered pumping technologies over time."
